# Dockerfile dùng context root repository, mặc định loại toàn bộ context.
*

# Chỉ giữ manifest, cấu hình compiler và source cần cho Product Service.
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/
!packages/common/
!packages/common/**
!services/
!services/product-service/
!services/product-service/package.json
!services/product-service/package-lock.json
!services/product-service/tsconfig.json
!services/product-service/tsconfig.build.json
!services/product-service/nest-cli.json
!services/product-service/src/
!services/product-service/src/**

# Không gửi dependency, artifact, secret và file phát triển vào build context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.e2e-spec.ts
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/*.log
